      "content": "That makes sense. I'll definitely leave some buffer time. One more thing—I'll be traveling with a lot of heavy professional equipment and presentation materials. Is it difficult to navigate the trains with bulky luggage, or is there a better way to handle that so I'm not struggling through the stations?",
